1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:06,643
It's Easter today. But there's nothing
exciting enough to get me out of bed.

2
00:00:06,693 --> 00:00:12,279
At our house, holidays are always the
same. Mom cooks for us and leaves for

3
00:00:12,279 --> 00:00:14,216
work early in the morning.

4
00:00:14,266 --> 00:00:19,628
My dad, my brother and I spend the day
watching TV. It's not much different

5
00:00:19,628 --> 00:00:20,987
from any other day.

6
00:00:21,037 --> 00:00:28,972
Still in bed, I thought I heard my
mother's voice. So I ran out to see.

7
00:00:29,022 --> 00:00:31,835
Mom is in the living room, making
coffee.

8
00:00:31,885 --> 00:00:35,241
Fresh grass covers the floor, and
incense is burning.

9
00:00:35,291 --> 00:00:42,927
My brother and my dad sit holding their
coffee. You can tell they're as happy as

10
00:00:42,927 --> 00:00:43,404
I am.

11
00:00:43,454 --> 00:00:45,358
I looked at them, and I was so happy.

12
00:00:46,454 --> 00:00:54,323
This is my first holiday memory with my
mother. To this day, it's the best day

13
00:00:54,323 --> 00:00:55,433
of my life.

14
00:00:55,483 --> 00:00:59,958
More than anything, showing up matters.
